  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ee3ef3871cf2cdb49b912311959757c7, type: 3}
  m_Name: F1-2 bandit jinxx 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b49ed812a317602409a266999ad2b928, type: 2}
    text: Bandits are harder to defeat since they are humans just like me.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b49ed812a317602409a266999ad2b928, type: 2}
    text: And I'm not fond of killing another human being.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b49ed812a317602409a266999ad2b928, type: 2}
    text: I hope I don't encounter any bandits ever again from now on.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b49ed812a317602409a266999ad2b928, type: 2}
    text: Although it's highly unlikely that I will encounter any more bandits from
      now on, since Im almost near to the Kivotos Village.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b49ed812a317602409a266999ad2b928, type: 2}
    text: Low life bandits are not stupid enough to camp near a settlement and risk
      getting caught by emperial knights.
